cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or the analysis it implements, please cite both the
  archived release and the accompanying paper.
title: >-
  ir-tda: topological descriptors of infrared spectra for formulated polymer
  compounds
abstract: >-
  Persistent homology applied to the IR/ATR spectra of 39 industrial footwear
  sole compounds. Implements exact degree-0 persistence of the superlevel-set
  filtration of a spectrum by union-find, the classical persistence image, and
  a position-aware variant over wavenumber and lifetime, together with the
  clustering, robustness, property-prediction, multimodal and control analyses
  reported in the paper.
